      <h2>3. Legal Basis for Processing (GDPR Compliance)</h2>
      <p>For visitors and customers situated in the European Economic Area (EEA) or the United Kingdom, our processing of your personal information rests upon the following recognized lawful grounds:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Performance of a Contract:</strong> Processing is essential to fulfill purchase contracts (e.g. shipping your order and providing customer support).</li>
        <li><strong>Consent:</strong> Where you have granted unambiguous permission (e.g. subscribing to product stock alerts or marketing newsletters). You retain the right to revoke consent at any time.</li>
        <li><strong>Legitimate Interests:</strong> Protecting our store against fraudulent transactions, improving store features, and maintaining system security.</li>
        <li><strong>Compliance with Legal Obligations:</strong> Preserving commercial invoices for tax authorities and responding to valid judicial demands.</li>
      </ul>
    </section>

