        <li><strong>Payment Gateways:</strong> Shopify Payments, Shop Pay, PayPal, and credit card processing networks under PCI-DSS Level 1 certification.</li>
        <li><strong>Freight & Delivery Carriers:</strong> FedEx Freight, UPS Ground, and USPS to deliver packages to your designated address and obtain required adult delivery signatures.</li>
        <li><strong>Legal & Regulatory Authorities:</strong> Only when strictly mandated by law, court order, or official governmental subpoena.</li>
      </ul>
      
